# SPA routing.
#
# The app uses BrowserRouter, so /today and /signin are routes the client
# resolves — there is no file at those paths. Without this, a refresh or a
# shared link 404s. The 200 (rather than 301) means the URL is preserved while
# index.html is served, which is what lets the router see the real path.
#
# Must come last: it matches everything, so any future API route or redirect
# belongs above it.
/*    /index.html   200
